  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "An accessibility issue. When navigating the VRChat 2026.4.1 (Build 1936) release notes page by links, a screen reader software will read \"here\", but there is no context where the link that says \"here\" goes to for non-visual users.\n\nhttps://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202641\n\nExpected result: \"You can read about it in [Face Tracking documentation]!\", or similar.\n\nActual result: \"You can read about it [here]!\"\n\nAdditional info: List of hyperlinks on the page: \"October 10, 2026 Developer Update\" (ok), \"here\" (ambiguous), \"custom cache directory\" (ok).",
